{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國駐泰國大使館表示，泰國近期發生多宗中國公民入境後失蹤失聯、遭非法拘禁並被誘騙轉運至泰緬邊境的案件。</p><p>不法分子以高薪招聘、商務考察、投資合作及直播演藝邀約為幌子實施犯罪。</p><p>中國駐泰國使館特此提醒赴泰中國公民提高安全防範。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T02:39:50.568390+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T02:21:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T21:57:33.057357+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T02:38:33.366623+00:00","content_hash":"75be575be1c154b16178dcf6d46c47743e127799504f68038d2d2bb82ba543d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}